    \ | 0.248 | 0.373 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.788 |\n| 481 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=2.5): Stronger Column Balancing (k=48) | Praxis I | 283 | 0.7327 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.780 |\n| 478 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=1.5): Milder Column Balancing (k=48) | Praxis I | 281 | 0.7328 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.782 |\n| 477 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + DMN: Dual-Metric Neighbors (cosine∪euclidean) with Per-Batch Quotas | Praxis I | 280 | 0.7327 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.780 |\n| 471 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=2.0), k=45: Degree Ridge Check | Praxis I | 276 | 0.7298 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.324 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 470 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=0.8, cap=2.0): Sensitivity Check (k=48) | Praxis I | 276 | 0.7347 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.372 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 |\
