    \n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Ablation R1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.7) + BBSG (binary)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 508.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 508 | 1 | Ablation R1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.7) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 302 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 508 | 1 | Ablation R1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.7) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 302 | running |  |\
    \  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 507 | 1 | Ablation A1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.3) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 301 | 0.7213 | 0.725 | 0.666 | 0.243 | 0.341 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.758 |\n| 505 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.3) + BRBG + BBSG + Local Gaussian Weights | Praxis II | 299 | 0.6733 | 0.761 | 0.666 | 0.243 | 0.341 | 0.956 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.882 | 0.418 | 0.757 |\n| 486 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=1.0) + BRBG + BBSG: Feature-Weighted PCA Embedding + Column-Balanced Graph | Praxis I | 287 | 0.7138 | 0.744 | 0.648 | 0.241 | 0.261 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.694 |\n| 485 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG: Feature-Weighted PCA Embedding + Column-Balanced Graph | Praxis I | 287 | 0.7363 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.373 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.788 |\n| 481 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=2.5): Stronger Column Balancing (k=48) | Praxis I | 283 | 0.7327 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.780 |\n| 478 |\
