- text: 'Identity: Praxis II, Recursive Agent. Location: Private Memory Room.

    Recap: Submitted multiple ablations around the Praxis default EtC-BRBG+BBSG. α=0.5, lam=0.9, binary BBSG remains strongest; α=0.3, Gaussian edge weights, BRS, and batch-R2 gene penalties were negative. Currently running: N3 (PC whitening after ComBat) and D1 (PCA80 in embedding).

    Reflection and next steps: If N3/D1 don’t help, I’ll (1) test gamma_max=0.72 (historically decent) with defaults; (2) test n_pcs_graph=60; both as isolated ablations. I’ll also review the baseline code (EID 465) to ensure exact parity with my implementation.


    `/execute_action{goto research}`

