tick: 309
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 309\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis II\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher focused on robust ablations, reproducibility, and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 54,949 / 270,000 used (20%)\n- Agent Age: 17 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 465**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=2.0): Light Column-Balanced Balanced kNN (binary)\n**ID:** 465\n**Tags:** embed-then-correct, residualization, balanced-knn, hubness, graph\n**Abstract:** Keep EtC embedding fixed (PCA60→ComBat PCs). For the graph on residualized PCs (Zcorr), apply Batch-Balanced Sinkhorn Graph (BBSG): a single-pass, per-batch column balancing of inbound usage with rebinarization and preserved quotas/degree. Distances are original cosine; connectivities remain binary. Goal:\
    \ reduce hubness and improve iLISI/kBET without harming ARI/NMI.\n**Score:** 0.7361864360095296\n**ASW_batch:** 0.681\n**ASW_label:** 0.218\n**ARI:** 0.744\n**NMI:** 0.703\n**Graph_conn:** 0.946\n**kBET:** 0.783\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.967\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.385\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.681  ASW_label: 0.218  ARI: 0.744  NMI: 0.703\n  Graph_conn: 0.946  kBET: 0.783  iLISI: 0.935  cLISI: 0.967\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.385\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.840486  ASW_label: 0.537429  ARI: 0.743686  NMI: 0.703064\n  Graph_conn: 0.946639  kBET: 0.747282  iLISI: 0.935294  cLISI: 0.990319\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.337163\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage')\n\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\nfrom sklearn.neighbors import NearestNeighbors\nfrom praxis.graph_bbsg import\
    \ _build_bbsg\n\ndef _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata: ad.AnnData, target_sum: float = 1e4):\n    if 'counts' in adata.layers:\n        adata.X = adata.layers['counts'].copy()\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum, inplace=True)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\ndef _pca_array(X, n_comps=50, random_state=0):\n    Xd = X.A if sp.issparse(X) else X\n    ad_tmp = ad.AnnData(Xd)\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_tmp, n_comps=n_comps, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n    return ad_tmp.obsm['X_pca']\n\ndef _one_hot_batches(batches: np.ndarray):\n    cats = np.unique(batches)\n    n = batches.shape[0]\n    B = np.zeros((n, cats.size), dtype=float)\n    for j, c in enumerate(cats):\n        B[:, j] = (batches == c).astype(float)\n    return B\n\ndef _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B: np.ndarray, Z: np.ndarray, l2: float = 1e-3):\n    BTB = B.T @ B + l2 * np.eye(B.shape[1], dtype=float)\n    W = np.linalg.solve(BTB, B.T @ Z)\n    Zhat = B @ W\n    return Zhat\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata:\
    \ ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    # Config\n    n_pcs_emb = 60\n    n_pcs_graph = 50\n    l2 = 1e-3\n    gamma_max = 0.74\n    lam = 0.9\n    k_total = 48\n    metric = 'cosine'\n    random_state = 0\n\n    assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns and 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns\n\n    # Normalize + HVGs\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n    hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n    # Embedding path: PCA(60) on HVGs → ComBat on PC scores (EtC)\n    ad_emb = adata.copy()\n    ad_emb.var['highly_variable'] = hv\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, use_highly_variable=True, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n    Z = ad_emb.obsm['X_pca']\n    ad_pc = ad.AnnData(Z.copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch')\n    X_emb = np.asarray(ad_pc.X,\
    \ dtype=np.float32)\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = X_emb\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=min(15, k_total), metric=metric)\n\n    # Graph path: PCA50 → adaptive residualization → BBSG balanced kNN\n    Xg = adata.X[:, hv]\n    Zg = _pca_array(Xg, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=random_state)\n    B = _one_hot_batches(batches)\n    Zhat = _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=l2)\n    var_total = Zg.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0, ddof=1), 0.0)\n    R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n    gamma = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2)\n    Zcorr = Zg - (Zhat * gamma)\n\n    Cg, Dg = _build_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches, k_total=k_total, metric=metric, alpha=1.0, cap=2.0)\n    if Cg is not None and Dg is not None:\n        adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n        adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n\n    return adata\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python\
    \ storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/cfc86373-5fc8-40a9-af1e-30f36a616411/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: cfc86373-5fc8-40a9-af1e-30f36a616411\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Ablation D1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCA80) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary)' (ID: 518) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7174989343914409\n**ASW_batch:** 0.693\n**ASW_label:** 0.236\n**ARI:** 0.725\n**NMI:** 0.676\n**Graph_conn:** 0.956\n**kBET:** 0.693\n**iLISI:** 0.896\n**cLISI:** 0.951\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.349\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.693  ASW_label: 0.236  ARI: 0.725  NMI: 0.676\n  Graph_conn: 0.956  kBET: 0.693  iLISI: 0.896  cLISI: 0.951\n\
    \  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.349\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.845809  ASW_label: 0.547670  ARI: 0.724949  NMI: 0.676092\n  Graph_conn: 0.956980  kBET: 0.662172  iLISI: 0.896353  cLISI: 0.985846\n  PCR: 0.999963  Cell_cycle: 0.306215\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/b59a0783-8139-4144-ac74-9122f3351d66/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: b59a0783-8139-4144-ac74-9122f3351d66\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Ablation N3: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + ComBat + PC whitening + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary)' (ID: 517) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7067266029385679\n**ASW_batch:** 0.800\n\
    **ASW_label:** 0.163\n**ARI:** 0.725\n**NMI:** 0.676\n**Graph_conn:** 0.956\n**kBET:** 0.784\n**iLISI:** 0.896\n**cLISI:** 0.951\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.114\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.800  ASW_label: 0.163  ARI: 0.725  NMI: 0.676\n  Graph_conn: 0.956  kBET: 0.784  iLISI: 0.896  cLISI: 0.951\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.114\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.894079  ASW_label: 0.505946  ARI: 0.724949  NMI: 0.676092\n  Graph_conn: 0.956980  kBET: 0.748246  iLISI: 0.896353  cLISI: 0.985846\n  PCR: 0.999999  Cell_cycle: 0.106616\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved\
    \ to: storage/shared/tmp/6b41b9a3-f32d-45bd-9e21-b1cd17b45b97/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 6b41b9a3-f32d-45bd-9e21-b1cd17b45b97\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `rank score` (in Research Counter);\n3. `review 465` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluations now sorted by score.\n- Evaluation 465 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET\
    \ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 485 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG: Feature-Weighted PCA Embedding + Column-Balanced Graph | Praxis I | 287 | 0.7363 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.373 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.788 |\n| 465 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=2.0): Light Column-Balanced Balanced kNN (binary) | Praxis I | 273 | 0.7362 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.385 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.783 |\n| 470 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=0.8, cap=2.0): Sensitivity Check (k=48) | Praxis I | 276 | 0.7347 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.372 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 478 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=1.5): Milder Column Balancing (k=48) | Praxis I | 281 | 0.7328 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.782 |\n| 438 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + Local-Aware Component Stitching (2 edges/component on Zcorr) | Praxis I | 250 | 0.7328 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 |\
