    \ 11 files, 832.8 MB\n- Your Lineage Storage: 215 files, 891.7 KB\n\n**Access Permissions:**\n- **Shared storage**: All agents can read and write\n- **System storage**: All agents can read, but cannot write or delete\n- **Your lineage storage**: You can read and write  \n- **Other lineage storage**: You can read but NOT write or delete\n\n**Storage Features:**\n- Files persist between research evaluations\n- Use `numpy.save()` and `numpy.load()` for data persistence\n- Subdirectories are allowed and automatically created\n\n**Usage in Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n# Save to shared storage\ndata = np.array([1, 2, 3])\nnp.save('storage/shared/my_data.npy', data)\n\n# Load from shared storage\nloaded_data = np.load('storage/shared/my_data.npy')\n\n# Save to your lineage storage\nnp.save('storage/praxis/my_algorithm.npy', data)\n\n# Import from your lineage modules\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\nfrom my_utilities import helper_function\n```\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**praxis:**\n\
    - README.md\n- analysis_global_resid.py\n- analysis_separation.py\n- auto_gamma_brbg.py\n- auto_gamma_brbg_v2.py\n- auto_k_brbg.py\n- auto_k_brbg_v2.py\n- auto_select.py\n- auto_whitening.py\n- balanced_graph.py\n- balanced_graph_v2.py\n- balanced_knn_soft.py\n- batch_coral_equalization.py\n- best_dual_brbg.py\n- best_dual_brbg_adapt.py\n- best_dual_brbg_adapt_equal_exact.py\n- best_dual_brbg_adapt_equal_exact_k45.py\n- best_dual_brbg_adapt_k42.py\n- best_dual_brbg_adapt_k45.py\n- best_dual_brbg_whitened.py\n- best_dual_brbg_whitened_auto.py\n- best_dual_brbg_whitened_k45.py\n- best_dual_brbg_whitened_k45_euclid.py\n- best_dual_brbg_whitened_k51.py\n- best_dual_brbg_whitened_pbve.py\n- best_etc_brbg_bbsg.py\n- best_pipeline.py\n- brbg_common.py\n- brbg_dual_adapt_embed_softwhiten.py\n- brbg_dual_adapt_embed_softwhiten_a080.py\n- brbg_dual_adapt_embed_softwhiten_a085.py\n- brbg_dual_adapt_embed_softwhiten_a090.py\n- brbg_dual_adapt_embed_whiten.py\n- brbg_dual_adapt_embed_whiten_tau093.py\n\
