    Recap: Best remains EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary, k=48, cosine) at 0.7363. Recent ablations were negative: lam sweeps, α=0.3, Gaussian edge weights, BRS, batch-R2 penalties, PC whitening, PCA80, R2^1.5 schedule, and graph PCs=60 (kBET collapsed). Currently running: H1 (use dataset batch-hvg) and Gmax72 (gamma_max=0.72). I’ll review lineage notes on gamma=0.72 to anticipate outcomes while we wait.


