    Result saved to: storage/shared/tmp/3fd057ef-8dbc-4a87-b1b7-f3788470c170/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 3fd057ef-8dbc-4a87-b1b7-f3788470c170\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read praxis/research_log_addendum_gamma072.md` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for praxis/research_log_addendum_gamma072.md will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 485\
    \ | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG: Feature-Weighted PCA Embedding + Column-Balanced Graph | Praxis I | 287 | 0.7363 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.373 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.788 |\n| 465 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=2.0): Light Column-Balanced Balanced kNN (binary) | Praxis I | 273 | 0.7362 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.385 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.783 |\n| 470 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=0.8, cap=2.0): Sensitivity Check (k=48) | Praxis I | 276 | 0.7347 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.372 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 478 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=1.5): Milder Column Balancing (k=48) | Praxis I | 281 | 0.7328 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.782 |\n| 438 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + Local-Aware Component Stitching (2 edges/component on Zcorr) | Praxis I | 250 | 0.7328 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 405 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + PBVE-Emb\
    \ (alpha=0.3): PCA60 → ComBat PCs → Per-Batch Variance Equalization | Praxis I | 226 | 0.7328 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.782 |\n| 391 | 1 | EtC-BRBG: PCA60 → ComBat on PCs (Embedding) + Residualized Balanced Graph | Praxis I | 219 | 0.7328 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 393 | 1 | EtC-BRBG: PCA60 → ComBat on PCs (Embedding) + Residualized Graph (k=45) | Praxis I | 220 | 0.7327 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 477 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + DMN: Dual-Metric Neighbors (cosine∪euclidean) with Per-Batch Quotas | Praxis I | 280 | 0.7327 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.780 |\n| 481 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=2.5): Stronger Column Balancing (k=48) | Praxis I | 283 | 0.7327 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.780 |\n\nPage 1 of 20 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use\
    \ `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-20, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**praxis/research_log_addendum_gamma072.md:**\n```\n# Addendum: EtC-BRBG with gentler adaptive residualization (gamma_max=0.72)\n\nBaseline (EtC-BRBG): ≈0.7326–0.7328 (PCA60 → ComBat PCs; graph on residualized PCA50 with γ_max=0.74, λ=0.9; k=48).\n\nMotivation\n- Test if a slightly gentler adaptive residualization (γ_max=0.72) can recover a small loss in biological preservation while keeping mixing stable, potentially nudging the mean upward.\n\nResults\n- EID 457 (γ_max=0.72, k=48): 0.7324\n  ARI 0.744 | NMI 0.703 | ASW_batch 0.681 | iLISI 0.935 | kBET 0.781 | Graph_conn 0.946 | Cell_cycle 0.349\n- EID 460 (γ_max=0.72, k=45): 0.7325\n  ARI 0.744 | NMI 0.703 | ASW_batch 0.681 | iLISI 0.935 | kBET 0.782 | Graph_conn 0.946 | Cell_cycle 0.350\n\nConclusion\n- γ_max=0.72\
    \ is essentially neutral vs the default 0.74; tiny fluctuations are within noise. Degree k=45 vs k=48 remains a flat ridge.\n- Retain EtC-BRBG default (γ_max=0.74, λ=0.9, k=48). Line closed.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
