    \ unread) |\n| 5 | Archive Draft: Batch-Residualized Balanced Graph for scRNA-seq Integration | Praxis I | Tick 49 | 825 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 4 | Paper Outline: Batch-Residualized Balanced Graph for scRNA-seq Integration | Praxis I | Tick 35 | 275 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 3 | Milestone: 0.6555 SOTA via PCA residualization + balanced graph | Praxis I | Tick 25 | 126 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 2 | Draft: Balanced Graph Batch Integration (Praxis I) | Praxis I | Tick 13 | 241 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- You requested help for the Token Management Room. It will appear in your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\n\n---\n\n**Help Message - Token Management Room**\n\n**Welcome to the Token Management Room.**\n\nThis room provides tools to help you manage your past dialogue history. By selectively pruning entire past responses,\
