    \ | 1 | Ablation E4: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCs=60, emb_n_neighbors=20) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 328 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 556 | 1 | Ablation E3: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCs=60, emb_n_neighbors=30) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 327 | 0.7228 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.788 |\n| 555 | 1 | Ablation E2: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCs=55) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 326 | 0.7172 | 0.725 | 0.648 | 0.252 | 0.329 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.738 |\n| 553 | 1 | Ablation E1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCs=50) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 325 | 0.7182 | 0.725 | 0.637 | 0.255 | 0.333 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.752 |\n| 545 | 1 | Ablation GW2: BRBG + BBSG with graph PC weights w_j=(1−R2_j)^0.75 | Praxis II | 320 | 0.7113 | 0.627 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.664 | 1.000 | 0.945 | 0.898 | 0.790 |\n| 543 | 1 | Ablation GW1: BRBG + BBSG with graph PC weights\
    \ w_j=(1−R2_j)^0.5 | Praxis II | 318 | 0.7259 | 0.739 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.957 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.948 | 0.897 | 0.789 |\n| 538 | 1 | Ablation K1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) with k=51 | Praxis II | 316 | 0.7226 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.325 | 0.957 | 0.675 | 1.000 | 0.950 | 0.898 | 0.790 |\n| 535 | 1 | Ablation B2: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG with candidate pool k_cand=2.5×quota | Praxis II | 315 | 0.7169 | 0.655 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.957 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.947 | 0.891 | 0.789 |\n| 534 | 1 | Ablation B1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG with deeper candidate pool (k_cand=3×quota) | Praxis II | 314 | 0.7170 | 0.656 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.952 | 0.695 | 1.000 | 0.946 | 0.898 | 0.789 |\n| 529 | 1 | Ablation Gmax72: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(gamma_max=0.72, lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 312 | 0.7229 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 21 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
