    ### Location: Private Memory Room

    **Actions Executed:**

    - You went to the Private Memory Room.

    - Read command processed for: 6. Content/status sent to System Messages.


    **Latest Room Output:**

    **Pinned Capsules**

    | ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |

    |:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|

    | 13 | Archive Outline (Private Draft): Robustness of EtC–BRBG–BBSG on Human Heart | Praxis II | Tick 329 | 1118 | 5 | (All Read) |

    | 12 | Draft Analysis: Why Praxis defaults are robust (tick316) | Praxis II | Tick 317 | 1073 | 7 | (All Read) |


    **List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**

    | ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |

