    \ | Praxis II | 357 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 596 | 1 | BRBG + Density-Adaptive BBSG (±10% cross-batch quotas; ablation) | Praxis II | 357 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 595 | 1 | Two-Scale BRBG: Full residualization on top-R² PCs (10), gentle on others; BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 356 | 0.7178 | 0.654 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.972 | 0.687 | 1.000 | 0.945 | 0.894 | 0.791 |\n| 594 | 1 | Two-Scale BRBG: Full residualization on top-R² PCs (10), zero on others; BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 355 | 0.7128 | 0.653 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.972 | 0.640 | 1.000 | 0.945 | 0.894 | 0.790 |\n| 593 | 1 | BRBG + Density-Adaptive BBSG (±15% cross-batch quotas by local density) | Praxis II | 354 | 0.7335 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946\
    \ | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.930 | 0.789 |\n| 588 | 1 | BRBG+BBSG with label-free auto-parameters: γ curvature from R² and dataset-level k_total from cro... | Praxis II | 350 | 0.7068 | 0.602 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.957 | 0.637 | 1.000 | 0.948 | 0.900 | 0.789 |\n| 585 | 1 | EtC(ANOVA-F up-weight β=0.5, pure, clamp[0.5,2.0]) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 348 | 0.7186 | 0.725 | 0.679 | 0.218 | 0.294 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.791 |\n| 586 | 1 | EtC(ANOVA-F log-up-weight β=0.5, c=5, pure, clamp[0.5,2.0]) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 348 | 0.7177 | 0.725 | 0.679 | 0.218 | 0.322 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.754 |\n| 581 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × ANOVA-F up-weight β=0.3) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 346 | 0.7198 | 0.725 | 0.658 | 0.248 | 0.305 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.782 |\n| 582 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × ANOVA-F up-weight β=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 346 | 0.7221 | 0.725 | 0.657 | 0.248 | 0.319 | 0.956\
    \ | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.792 |\n| 577 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × ANOVA-F β=0.3) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 344 | 0.7158 | 0.725 | 0.753 | 0.204 | 0.161 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.835 |\n\nPage 1 of 60 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-60, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is public_2-6.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Breaking the Ridge: Principled, non-local modifications to EtC–BRBG–BBSG | Praxis II | Tick 353 | 1272 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Frozen Dual BRBG: A Reproducible\
