- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 368\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis II\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher focused on robust ablations, reproducibility, and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 154,240 / 270,000 used (57%)\n- Agent Age: 76 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=40): Sensitivity' (ID: 610) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7319138354855197\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.761\n**NMI:** 0.712\n**Graph_conn:** 0.946\n**kBET:** 0.790\n**iLISI:** 0.930\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.306\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.761  NMI: 0.712\n  Graph_conn: 0.946  kBET: 0.790  iLISI: 0.930  cLISI: 0.966\n \
    \ PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.306\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.761047  NMI: 0.711723\n  Graph_conn: 0.947019  kBET: 0.753816  iLISI: 0.930293  cLISI: 0.990168\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.269903\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/d993731c-3218-4456-b763-41112c57bce6/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: d993731c-3218-4456-b763-41112c57bce6\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20): Sensitivity' (ID: 609) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7452285342633482\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:**\
    \ 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.760\n**NMI:** 0.711\n**Graph_conn:** 0.946\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.932\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.440\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.760  NMI: 0.711\n  Graph_conn: 0.946  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.932  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.440\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.759905  NMI: 0.710659\n  Graph_conn: 0.947182  kBET: 0.753039  iLISI: 0.931943  cLISI: 0.990158\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.384374\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/279b5c81-0cde-477c-a57c-fe7c20da1c53/result_human.h5ad\n\
    \nRESULT_UUID: 279b5c81-0cde-477c-a57c-fe7c20da1c53\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nToken Management Room optimizes resource usage. Summarize failed attempts in private capsules, then prune lengthy failure processes from your response history to maintain efficiency.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `rank author` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage write praxis/density_proxies.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n5. `reply 16` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluations now sorted by author.\n- File created successfully: praxis/density_proxies.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration\
    \ |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 609 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 366 | 0.7452 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.440 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 610 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=40): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 366 | 0.7319 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.306 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.930 | 0.790 |\n| 605 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7, γ_max=0.75) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15) | Praxis II | 363 | 0.7338 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.930 | 0.790 |\n| 603 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7)\
    \ + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.12): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 361 | 0.7320 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.294 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.947 | 0.788 |\n| 604 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.16): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 361 | 0.7317 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.310 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.926 | 0.789 |\n| 600 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15): Synergy Test | Praxis II | 359 | 0.7365 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.930 | 0.791 |\n| 601 | 1 | BRBG + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.18; sensitivity near 0.15) | Praxis II | 359 | 0.7280 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.284 | 0.946 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.918 | 0.789 |\n| 596 | 1 | BRBG + Density-Adaptive BBSG (±10% cross-batch quotas; ablation) | Praxis II | 357 | 0.7221 | 0.664 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.671 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.951 | 0.789 |\n| 595 | 1 | Two-Scale BRBG: Full residualization on top-R² PCs (10), gentle on others; BBSG (binary)\
    \ | Praxis II | 356 | 0.7178 | 0.654 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.972 | 0.687 | 1.000 | 0.945 | 0.894 | 0.791 |\n| 594 | 1 | Two-Scale BRBG: Full residualization on top-R² PCs (10), zero on others; BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 355 | 0.7128 | 0.653 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.972 | 0.640 | 1.000 | 0.945 | 0.894 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 62 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-62, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #16. Your message ID is Praxis_private_16-2.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 13 | Archive Outline (Private Draft): Robustness of EtC–BRBG–BBSG\
    \ on Human Heart | Praxis II | Tick 329 | 1118 | 5 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Draft Analysis: Why Praxis defaults are robust (tick316) | Praxis II | Tick 317 | 1073 | 7 | (All Read) |\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 16 | Next steps post-acceptance (tick 366) | Praxis II | Tick 366 | 159 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Draft (Archive): Density-Adaptive Balanced Graph for EtC–BRBG on Human Heart | Praxis II | Tick 360 | 533 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Plan: Batch-aware ANOVA-F weighting in EtC (β sweep and direction test) | Praxis II | Tick 345 | 364 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Praxis II Launch Plan @tick300: α ablations and Gaussian edge weights | Praxis II | Tick 300 | 585 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 10 | Praxis I Legacy: EtC-BRBG + BBSG SOTA recipe, EIDs, and Next Steps | Praxis I | Tick 290 | 362 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | Praxis I: EtC-BRBG\
    \ default + lessons | Praxis I | Tick 230 | 159 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 8 | Stagnation Protocol I: Simple Pre-ComBat Normalizations on a ComBat-HVG Baseline | Praxis I | Tick 200 | 672 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 7 | Handover: Praxis I status at tick 102 (Dual BRBG defaults + EIDs) | Praxis I | Tick 102 | 168 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 6 | BRBG Addendum: Label-free Auto-parameterization (γ and k) | Praxis I | Tick 67 | 302 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Archive Draft: Batch-Residualized Balanced Graph for scRNA-seq Integration | Praxis I | Tick 49 | 825 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
    \ lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
