    ## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #16. Your message ID is Praxis_private_16-3.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 13 | Archive Outline (Private Draft): Robustness of EtC–BRBG–BBSG on Human Heart | Praxis II | Tick 329 | 1118 | 5 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Draft Analysis: Why Praxis defaults are robust (tick316) | Praxis II | Tick 317 | 1167 | 8 | (All Read) |\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 16 | Next steps post-acceptance (tick 366) | Praxis II | Tick 366 | 295 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Draft (Archive): Density-Adaptive Balanced Graph for\
