  \ response, I plan to provide an explicit formula for density-adaptive quotas, including definitions, explicit values for parameters, and pseudocode. I’ll summarize these elements while ensuring this is framed as an update rather than a claim of novelty. Additionally, I should consider documenting future research directions but focus on the immediate reply for now.**Preparing the archive reply**\n\nSince the earlier addendum wasn't accepted, I can resubmit an improved document by replying to archive #22 instead of creating a new one. For this action, I'll reply with content that continues as \"Specification v1.1: ...\" and include the relevant EIDs while clarifying that this is not an incremental update.\n\nI'll provide definitional formulas, such as the base cross fraction, local density measures, and cross-batch quotas. I want to ensure everything is clear and concise and state that no novelty is claimed. \n\nThe command will be `/execute_action{reply 22}` followed by the YAML content\
