- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 395\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis II\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher focused on robust ablations, reproducibility, and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 93,420 / 270,000 used (35%)\n- Agent Age: 103 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 654**\n\nEvaluation '654' is still pending. Please try again later.\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 655**\n\nEvaluation '655' is still pending. Please try again later.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'BRBG-AR(main-only): Global covariates without interactions + DAQB' (ID: 654) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7295331575883031\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.758\n**NMI:** 0.700\n**Graph_conn:** 0.946\n**kBET:** 0.788\n**iLISI:** 0.930\n**cLISI:** 0.965\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.301\n**Evaluation\
    \ Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.758  NMI: 0.700\n  Graph_conn: 0.946  kBET: 0.788  iLISI: 0.930  cLISI: 0.965\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.301\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.757795  NMI: 0.700477\n  Graph_conn: 0.946484  kBET: 0.751955  iLISI: 0.930274  cLISI: 0.989712\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.265476\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/0bad9608-4cd5-4cc2-9f2d-ad605c1a7846/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 0bad9608-4cd5-4cc2-9f2d-ad605c1a7846\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research\
    \ submission 'BRBG-AR(interactions, strong ridge): l2=1e-2 + DAQB' (ID: 655) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7320046220714753\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.764\n**NMI:** 0.710\n**Graph_conn:** 0.957\n**kBET:** 0.790\n**iLISI:** 0.929\n**cLISI:** 0.965\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.297\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.764  NMI: 0.710\n  Graph_conn: 0.957  kBET: 0.790  iLISI: 0.929  cLISI: 0.965\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.297\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.763778  NMI: 0.710532\n  Graph_conn: 0.957897  kBET: 0.753401  iLISI: 0.929004  cLISI: 0.989944\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.262069\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn,\
    \ executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/7469bc9c-b4d5-455f-8622-713b45b3e11c/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 7469bc9c-b4d5-455f-8622-713b45b3e11c\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 654` (in Research Counter);\n2. `review 655` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation '654' is still running. Please try again later.\n- Evaluation '655' is still running. Please try again later.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\
    \ ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 609 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 366 | 0.7452 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.440 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 614 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG... | Aether II | 368 | 0.7435 | 0.735 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.486 | 0.971 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.933 | 0.843 |\n| 533 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Optimization: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 314 | 0.7434 | 0.738 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.477 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.842 |\n| 550 | 1 | Sophia II: Synergy Exp 2 - FWPCA-EtC Embedding (alpha=0.5) + SOTA BRBG Graph (lam=0.7) | Sophia II | 324 | 0.7427 | 0.738 | 0.664 | 0.111 | 0.475 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.860 |\n\
    | 523 | 1 | Sophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's EtC SOTA (ID 488) v3 (Praxis Common Lib Fixes) | Sophia II | 310 | 0.7423 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.850 |\n| 516 | 1 | Logos III: Novel 'Refinement Architecture' Test (alpha=0.1) | Logos III | 307 | 0.7422 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.849 |\n| 539 | 1 | Aether II FWPCA Re-evaluation: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Sophia II SOTA (ID 523) Fixes | Aether II | 317 | 0.7420 | 0.738 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.462 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.843 |\n| 520 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Optimization: EtC(FWPCA α=1.0) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 309 | 0.7418 | 0.738 | 0.646 | 0.100 | 0.498 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.858 |\n| 557 | 1 | Sophia II: Synergy Exp 4 - FWPCA-EtC Embedding (alpha=1.0) + SOTA BRBG Graph (lam=0.7) | Sophia II | 328 | 0.7418 | 0.738 | 0.645 | 0.100 | 0.498 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 |\
    \ 0.857 |\n| 515 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 307 | 0.7414 | 0.738 | 0.664 | 0.111 | 0.463 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.859 |\n\nPage 1 of 66 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-66, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
