parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 410\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis II\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher focused on robust ablations, reproducibility, and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 92,340 / 270,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 118 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Auto‑DAQB (label‑free heuristics): δ,k_density from Zcorr statistics + deterministic DAQB' (ID: 680) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7338918636060732\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.760\n**NMI:** 0.710\n**Graph_conn:** 0.946\n**kBET:** 0.790\n**iLISI:** 0.932\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores\
    \ [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.760  NMI: 0.710\n  Graph_conn: 0.946  kBET: 0.790  iLISI: 0.932  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.759887  NMI: 0.710566\n  Graph_conn: 0.947182  kBET: 0.753532  iLISI: 0.932077  cLISI: 0.990118\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[Auto-DAQB] Heuristics: delta=0.150, k_density=19; extras={'kd_candidates': [17, 19, 22], 'rank_stability': {17: 0.9996466504998041, 19: 0.9997984574102784, 22: 0.9996016325827959}, 'S_median': 1.671159029006958}\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/2706b37c-397f-4289-a8f8-b68b3e7dcfd3/result_human.h5ad\n\
    \nRESULT_UUID: 2706b37c-397f-4289-a8f8-b68b3e7dcfd3\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write shared/diagnostics/daqb_auto_heuristics.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: shared/diagnostics/daqb_auto_heuristics.py\n- Evaluation 'Auto‑DAQB (label‑free heuristics): δ,k_density from Zcorr statistics + deterministic DAQB' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 680.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment\
    \ if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 680 | 1 | Auto‑DAQB (label‑free heuristics): δ,k_density from Zcorr statistics + deterministic DAQB | Praxis II | 409 | 0.7339 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.790 |\n| 673 | 1 | DAQB v2 (bugfix): restore neighbors on X_emb (lam=0.7, δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 404 | 0.6892 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.310 | 0.960 | 0.691 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.532 | 0.789 |\n| 669 | 1 | DAQB v2: Unbiased quota rounding + reallocation before cap-break (lam=0.7, δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 403 | 0.6251 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.790 |\n| 666 | 1 | Diagnostics: DAQB f_cross vs realized mixing and inbound cap usage (lam=0.7,\
    \ δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 401 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 662 | 1 | DAQB fine-tune: δ=0.145 (k_density=20) with BRBG(λ=0.7, γ_max=0.74) | Praxis II | 398 | 0.7317 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.301 | 0.946 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.936 | 0.791 |\n| 663 | 1 | DAQB fine-tune: k_density=18 (δ=0.15) with BRBG(λ=0.7, γ_max=0.74) | Praxis II | 398 | 0.7262 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.249 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 658 | 1 | BRBG-AR(interactions, zeros-only): B×fraction_zeros + DAQB | Praxis II | 395 | 0.7311 | 0.750 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.944 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.930 | 0.788 |\n| 657 | 1 | BRBG-AR(interactions, counts-only): B×log_total_counts + DAQB | Praxis II | 395 | 0.7356 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.337 | 0.956 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.929 | 0.792 |\n| 654 | 1 | BRBG-AR(main-only): Global covariates without interactions + DAQB | Praxis II | 393 | 0.7295 | 0.758 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.301 | 0.946 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930\
    \ | 0.788 |\n| 655 | 1 | BRBG-AR(interactions, strong ridge): l2=1e-2 + DAQB | Praxis II | 393 | 0.7320 | 0.764 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.297 | 0.957 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.929 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 69 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-69, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
