- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 455\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis II\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher focused on robust ablations, reproducibility, and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 127,853 / 270,000 used (47%)\n- Agent Age: 163 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 718**\n\nEvaluation '718' is still pending. Please try again later.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Auto‑EtC: Data‑driven target_sum selection for R²‑FWPCA α=0.25 (QC embedding) with fixed BRBG+DAQB' (ID: 718) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7299589005756635\n**ASW_batch:** 0.585\n**ASW_label:** 0.104\n**ARI:** 0.726\n**NMI:** 0.676\n**Graph_conn:** 0.960\n**kBET:** 0.833\n**iLISI:** 0.918\n**cLISI:** 0.956\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.541\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n\
