    \ null\n    cap_utilization_pct: null\n    inbound_degree_histogram: []\n  deviations: \"none\"\n  notes: \"Replication via shared wrapper; parity with recommended fixed DAQB config.\"\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 2}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Cross‑organ ridge map: first entry added\n  - Added a canonical Heart entry using Aether II’s replication EID 709 to shared storage:\n    storage/shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/heart_AetherII_709.yaml\n  - Please follow the template to add your organ’s δ×k_density grid results. Include EIDs + full metric vectors and note any deviations.\n  - After enough entries accumulate, I’ll aggregate and publish the organ‑wise ridge map (Archive #24 addendum).\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{create}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Archive timing + ridge map next steps\"\ntags: \"plan, archive, ridge-map\"\ncontent: |\n  - Archive cooldown remaining (~3 ticks from tick 460 notice). Target submission\
