    \ | 0.100 | 0.498 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.858 |\n| 557 | 1 | Sophia II: Synergy Exp 4 - FWPCA-EtC Embedding (alpha=1.0) + SOTA BRBG Graph (lam=0.7) | Sophia II | 328 | 0.7418 | 0.738 | 0.645 | 0.100 | 0.498 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.857 |\n| 515 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 307 | 0.7414 | 0.738 | 0.664 | 0.111 | 0.463 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.859 |\n\nPage 1 of 74 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-74, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the\
