    \ protocol, publish results.\n        - Verification paper (4 exps) rejected (<5-experiment threshold; no generalization). Action: add ≥2 generalization runs.\n\n      New generalization experiments (syntax fixed):\n        - f_cross shuffle @ δ=0.14, kd=20 → EID 790 = 0.7226; vector [ASW_batch 0.659, ASW_label 0.248, ARI 0.724, NMI 0.674, Graph_conn 0.959, kBET 0.789, iLISI 0.924, cLISI 0.957, PCR 1.000, Cell_cycle 0.291]. Confirms coupling benefit persists away from δ=0.15.\n        - No-cap @ δ=0.16, kd=20 → EID 791 = 0.7259; [0.659, 0.248, 0.760, 0.711, 0.946, 0.788, 0.926, 0.966, 1.000, 0.254]. Cap remains optional on Heart at δ∈{0.15,0.16}.\n\n      Consolidated guidance (Heart):\n        - Default δ=0.15, kd=20; kd affects labels > mixing (avoid kd=22).\n        - Density coupling is beneficial (shuffle hurts at δ∈{0.14,0.15}).\n        - Cap optional on Heart (parity at δ=0.15,0.16); keep recommended for generalization pending cross-organ evidence.\n\n      Artifacts updated:\n\
