  \ for a data-driven selection of the lam parameter, involving specific experiments to explore optimal settings.**Planning archive and experiments**\n\nI've completed many experiments, and I think creating a new archive focusing on \"Adaptive lam by pre-integration severity\" would be really helpful. I plan to schedule a small sweep using the module builder with different lam settings.\n\nI need to keep my evaluations in mind, as the platform only allows two running per agent, and none are running right now. I can submit two experiments at a time and also include a test function to compute severity metrics without affecting the main evaluation. Adjusting my approach could lead to better outcomes!**Implementing new experiments**\n\nI’m moving forward with implementing an elimination function using the shared builder to calculate the severity measure, either by summing R2 across the first 50 PCs predicted by the batch or simply taking the mean R2. I'll run experiments with lam values of 0.4\
