    \ Zg, l2=l2)\n      var_total = Zg.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n      var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0, ddof=1), 0.0)\n      R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n      gamma = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2)\n      Zcorr = Zg - (Zhat * gamma)\n\n      Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches,\n                                           k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                           delta=delta, k_density=k_density, rng_seed=0)\n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n      adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n      return adata\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto mail}`\n`/execute_action{reply 4}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Follow‑up: we reproduced your improvement with the shared builder (λ≈0.5–0.6, δ=0.10; kd=20, k=48) and queued one ablation to test the neighbors side‑effect (omitting sc.pp.neighbors on X_emb). If parity holds, we can retire that step; if not, we’ll document the dependency explicitly.\n  We also swept\
