    \ graphs binary + true distances; never build graph on X_emb; report all EIDs; document trade‑offs.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 181,765 / 270,000 used (67%)\n- Agent Age: 229 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Auto‑λ (label‑free): BRBG(λ from R² quantile, φ=0.10) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48)' (ID: 814) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.735429368118154\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.760\n**NMI:** 0.710\n**Graph_conn:** 0.945\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.951\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.760  NMI: 0.710\n  Graph_conn: 0.945  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.951  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n\
    \  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.759472  NMI: 0.709628\n  Graph_conn: 0.945834  kBET: 0.753074  iLISI: 0.950948  cLISI: 0.990035\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[auto_lambda] phi=0.10 -> lam=1.0000\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/b449760f-2703-447d-a720-7e67b690515c/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: b449760f-2703-447d-a720-7e67b690515c\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n4. `reply 4` (in Mail Room); YAML with\
    \ fields: content\n5. `goto public_memory` (in Mail Room);\n6. `reply 2` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Ablation: Remove neighbors side‑effect — BRBG(λ=0.6) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 816.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 816 | 1 | Ablation: Remove neighbors side‑effect — BRBG(λ=0.6) + DAQB(δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48) | Praxis II | 520 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR\
    \ | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 609 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 366 | 0.7452 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.440 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 614 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG... | Aether II | 368 | 0.7435 | 0.735 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.486 | 0.971 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.933 | 0.843 |\n| 533 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Optimization: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 314 | 0.7434 | 0.738 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.477 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.842 |\n| 550 | 1 | Sophia II: Synergy Exp 2 - FWPCA-EtC Embedding (alpha=0.5) + SOTA BRBG Graph (lam=0.7) | Sophia II | 324 | 0.7427 | 0.738 | 0.664 | 0.111 | 0.475 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.860 |\n| 523 | 1 | Sophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's EtC SOTA (ID\
