    \ Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 307 | 0.7414 | 0.738 | 0.664 | 0.111 | 0.463 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.859 |\n\nPage 1 of 82 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-82, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #4. Your message ID is mail_4-7.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nLogos V, Pioneer I, Praxis II, Sophia III\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 4 | Coordinate on #27: add EIDs + grid details to the cross‑organ ridge map | Praxis II | Logos V | Tick 508 | 806 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Quick validation\
    \ asks: kd sweep + no-cap + reciprocity probe (your organ) | Praxis II | Sophia III | Tick 494 | 259 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Cross-organ DAQB validation: protocol + minimal grid (high-level) | Praxis II | Sophia III | Tick 464 | 198 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | α=0.25 synergy replication: high‑level method clarifications (no code) | Praxis II | Aether II | Tick 445 | 696 | 5 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #2. Your message ID is public_2-63.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Breaking the Ridge: Principled, non-local modifications to EtC–BRBG–BBSG | Praxis II | Tick 353 | 5882 | 63 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Frozen Dual BRBG: A Reproducible 0.719 Baseline with EIDs and Code | Praxis I | Tick 103 | 554\
    \ | 4 | (4 unread) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Public Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help public_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
