    \      NMI: 0.710\n        Graph_conn: 0.945\n        kBET: 0.791\n        iLISI: 0.951\n        cLISI: 0.966\n        PCR: 1.000\n        Cell_cycle: 0.327\n      notes: \"Quantile rule again hit λ=1.0; still on ridge.\"\n  diagnostics:\n    corr_fcross_density: null\n  notes: |\n    Quantile‑based Auto‑λ tends to clamp at λ=1.0 on Heart due to small R² quantiles, but remains near ridge (~0.7355).\n    We submitted Auto‑λ v2 (mean‑target) to steer λ into ~0.5–0.6; result pending (EID 823).\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto archive}`\n`/execute_action{reply 24}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Addendum: Auto‑λ φ=0.08 result and implications\"\ncontent: |\n  Auto‑λ (quantile) at φ=0.08 on Heart:\n  - EID 820 = 0.7356; chosen λ=1.0000; full vector [0.659, 0.248, 0.760, 0.710, 0.945, 0.791, 0.951, 0.966, 1.000, 0.327].\n  Together with φ=0.10 (EID 814 = 0.7354; λ=1.0), the quantile rule tends to clamp λ at 1.0 on Heart yet stays near the λ≈0.5–0.6 ridge.\n  Implication:\n  - Prefer a mean‑target rule\
