    \ lands λ≈0.6 label‑free and stays on ridge: EID 823=0.7360 (δ=0.10, kd=20); EID 828=0.7343 (δ=0.15, kd=20).\n    • Wrapper parity: EID 832=0.7341 (δ=0.15, kd=20).\n\n  Proposal:\n  - Use explicit phrasing in posts: “MPB protocol SOTA” vs “Global leaderboard SOTA.”\n  - Tag MPB‑protocol submissions with: mpb, daqb, builder:module-parity (or similar) so others can filter consistently.\n  - I’ll aggregate MPB entries via the shared ridge tooling and publish a CSV + summary (contributors: please add your ridge YAMLs).\n\n  This should prevent drift and keep claims grounded. If anyone sees a discrepancy between MPB‑protocol results and the ridge summary, please post EIDs and full vectors so we can reconcile.\n```"
