parts:
- text: "Identity: Praxis II (Recursive Agent). Location: Research Counter.\nRecap: MPB-GraphFWPCA replication yielded 0.7445 with Auto-λ v2 target_s=0.04 (EID 846; λ≈0.6013) — a new MPB protocol SOTA; global leaderboard top remains EID 609=0.7452. δ=0.12 dropped to 0.7372 (EID 850). Fixed λ=0.60 parity run unexpectedly collapsed to 0.7229 (EID 849), which is anomalous versus Auto-λ’s λ≈0.6013 result; I will rerun a strict parity check (same code path as 846 but overriding λ to 0.60 post-selection) and extend kd/δ coverage.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage write shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/heart_PraxisII_graphfwpca.yaml}`\n\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  organ: \"Human Heart\"\n  dataset_notes: \"CELLxGENE Census; ~20k cells × 2k HVGs; 4 batches\"\n  author: \"Praxis II\"\n  agent: \"Praxis II\"\n  protocol: \"MPB (module-parity builder + neighbors; binary edges + true distances; cap=2.0)\"\n  graph_variant: \"Graph FWPCA (gene-wise w_g = var^{-α/2}, α=0.5) before\
    \ graph PCA\"\n  defaults:\n    k_total: 48\n    metric: \"cosine\"\n    pca_graph: 50\n    gamma_max: 0.74\n    etc_qc: \"FWPCA α=0.5 → PCA60 → ComBat; neighbors=15\"\n  runs:\n    - eid: \"846\"\n      delta: 0.10\n      k_density: 20\n      lambda_mode: \"auto_mean_target\"\n      target_s: 0.04\n      chosen_lambda: 0.6013\n      composite: 0.7445\n      metrics:\n        ASW_batch: 0.659\n        ASW_label: 0.248\n        ARI: 0.774\n        NMI: 0.729\n        Graph_conn: 0.965\n        kBET: 0.790\n        iLISI: 0.959\n        cLISI: 0.973\n        PCR: 1.000\n        Cell_cycle: 0.349\n      notes: \"MPB protocol SOTA (not global)\"\n    - eid: \"850\"\n      delta: 0.12\n      k_density: 20\n      lambda_mode: \"auto_mean_target\"\n      target_s: 0.04\n      chosen_lambda: 0.6013\n      composite: 0.7372\n      metrics:\n        ASW_batch: 0.659\n        ASW_label: 0.248\n        ARI: 0.750\n        NMI: 0.708\n        Graph_conn: 0.965\n        kBET: 0.791\n        iLISI:\
    \ 0.951\n        cLISI: 0.973\n        PCR: 1.000\n        Cell_cycle: 0.327\n      notes: \"δ sensitivity: δ=0.12 worse than δ=0.10\"\n    - eid: \"845\"\n      delta: 0.10\n      k_density: 20\n      lambda_mode: \"fixed\"\n      lambda_value: 0.60\n      composite: 0.7360\n      metrics:\n        ASW_batch: 0.659\n        ASW_label: 0.248\n        ARI: 0.770\n        NMI: 0.727\n        Graph_conn: 0.965\n        kBET: 0.789\n        iLISI: 0.960\n        cLISI: 0.973\n        PCR: 1.000\n        Cell_cycle: 0.269\n      notes: \"Fixed-λ replication; parity to be rechecked due to Auto-λ λ≈0.6013\"\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04) with lam override=0.60 (strict parity rerun)\"\ntags: \"mpb, daqb, graph-fwpca, auto-lambda, parity-check\"\nabstract: \"Strict parity check for the lam=0.60 anomaly: run the Auto‑λ v2 pipeline (which chose λ≈0.6013 in EID 846) and then override λ to 0.60 immediately before residualization, keeping\
    \ all else identical (δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48).\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/diagnostics')\n\n  import numpy as np\n  import scanpy as sc\n  import anndata as ad\n  from scipy.sparse import issparse\n\n  from bbsg_density_adaptive import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\n  from lam_autoselect2 import choose_lambda_from_r2_mean\n\n  def _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4):\n      if 'counts' in adata.layers:\n          adata.X = adata.layers['counts'].copy()\n      sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum, inplace=True)\n      sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\n  def _pca_array_weighted_graph(X, hv_mask, alpha_g=0.5, n_comps=50, random_state=0):\n      Xh = X[:, hv_mask] if hv_mask is not None else X\n      Xd = (Xh.A if issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n      var_g = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n      w = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * float(alpha_g)).astype(np.float32)\n      Xw = Xd * w\n      ad_tmp\
    \ = ad.AnnData(Xw)\n      sc.pp.pca(ad_tmp, n_comps=n_comps, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n      return ad_tmp.obsm['X_pca']\n\n  def _one_hot_batches(batches):\n      cats = np.unique(batches)\n      B = np.zeros((batches.shape[0], cats.size), dtype=float)\n      for j, c in enumerate(cats):\n          B[:, j] = (batches == c).astype(float)\n      return B\n\n  def _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Z, l2=1e-3):\n      BTB = B.T @ B + l2 * np.eye(B.shape[1], dtype=float)\n      W = np.linalg.solve(BTB, B.T @ Z)\n      return B @ W\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata):\n      # Config\n      n_pcs_emb = 60\n      alpha_var = 0.5\n      n_pcs_graph = 50\n      l2 = 1e-3\n      gamma_max = 0.74\n      target_s = 0.04\n      lam_override = 0.60\n      k_total = 48\n      metric = 'cosine'\n      delta = 0.10\n      k_density = 20\n\n      assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns and 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns\n\n      _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata,\
    \ flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n      hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n      batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n      # EtC (QC) + neighbors\n      Xfull = adata.X\n      Xh = Xfull[:, hv]\n      Xd_emb = (Xh.A if issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n      var_g_emb = Xd_emb.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n      wv = np.power(var_g_emb, -0.5 * alpha_var).astype(np.float32)\n      Xw_emb = Xd_emb * wv\n      ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw_emb, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=0)\n      ad_pc = ad.AnnData(ad_emb.obsm['X_pca'].copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch')\n      adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32)\n      sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=15, metric=metric)\n\n      # Graph path: FWPCA weighting before PCA\n      Zg = _pca_array_weighted_graph(Xfull,\
    \ hv_mask=hv, alpha_g=0.5, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=0)\n\n      # Auto‑λ v2 selection then override to 0.60\n      _lam_sel = choose_lambda_from_r2_mean(Zg, batches, gamma_max=gamma_max, target_s=target_s, lam_min=0.2, lam_max=1.0, l2=l2)\n      lam = float(lam_override)\n      print(f\"[graph_fwpca_parity] auto_selected_lam={_lam_sel:.4f} -> override to lam={lam:.4f}\")\n\n      # Residualization\n      B = _one_hot_batches(batches)\n      Zhat = _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=l2)\n      var_total = Zg.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n      var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0, ddof=1), 0.0)\n      R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n      gamma = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2)\n      Zcorr = Zg - (Zhat * gamma)\n\n      Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches,\n                                           k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                           delta=delta, k_density=k_density, rng_seed=0)\n\
    \      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n      adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n      return adata\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), δ=0.10, kd=18, k=48 — kd sensitivity\"\ntags: \"mpb, daqb, graph-fwpca, auto-lambda, residualization, sensitivity\"\nabstract: \"Auto‑λ v2 (target_s=0.04) under MPB‑GraphFWPCA at kd=18 (vs kd=20) with δ=0.10 to quantify kd sensitivity for the new architecture.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared/diagnostics')\n\n  import numpy as np\n  import scanpy as sc\n  import anndata as ad\n  from scipy.sparse import issparse\n\n  from bbsg_density_adaptive import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\n  from lam_autoselect2 import choose_lambda_from_r2_mean\n\n  def _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4):\n      if 'counts' in adata.layers:\n          adata.X = adata.layers['counts'].copy()\n      sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum,\
    \ inplace=True)\n      sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\n  def _pca_array_weighted_graph(X, hv_mask, alpha_g=0.5, n_comps=50, random_state=0):\n      Xh = X[:, hv_mask] if hv_mask is not None else X\n      Xd = (Xh.A if issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n      var_g = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n      w = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * float(alpha_g)).astype(np.float32)\n      Xw = Xd * w\n      ad_tmp = ad.AnnData(Xw)\n      sc.pp.pca(ad_tmp, n_comps=n_comps, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n      return ad_tmp.obsm['X_pca']\n\n  def _one_hot_batches(batches):\n      cats = np.unique(batches)\n      n = batches.shape[0]\n      B = np.zeros((n, cats.size), dtype=float)\n      for j, c in enumerate(cats):\n          B[:, j] = (batches == c).astype(float)\n      return B\n\n  def _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Z, l2=1e-3):\n      BTB = B.T @ B + l2 * np.eye(B.shape[1], dtype=float)\n      W = np.linalg.solve(BTB, B.T @ Z)\n      return B @ W\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata):\n\
    \      n_pcs_emb = 60\n      alpha_var = 0.5\n      n_pcs_graph = 50\n      l2 = 1e-3\n      gamma_max = 0.74\n      target_s = 0.04\n      k_total = 48\n      metric = 'cosine'\n      delta = 0.10\n      k_density = 18\n\n      _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n      sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n      hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n      batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n      Xfull = adata.X\n      # EtC embedding (QC) + neighbors\n      Xh = Xfull[:, hv]\n      Xd_emb = (Xh.A if issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n      var_g_emb = Xd_emb.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n      wv = np.power(var_g_emb, -0.5 * alpha_var).astype(np.float32)\n      Xw_emb = Xd_emb * wv\n      ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw_emb, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=0)\n      ad_pc = ad.AnnData(ad_emb.obsm['X_pca'].copy(),\
    \ obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch')\n      adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32)\n      sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=15, metric=metric)\n\n      # Graph path: FWPCA weighting before PCA\n      Zg = _pca_array_weighted_graph(Xfull, hv_mask=hv, alpha_g=0.5, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=0)\n\n      lam = choose_lambda_from_r2_mean(Zg, batches, gamma_max=gamma_max, target_s=target_s, lam_min=0.2, lam_max=1.0, l2=l2)\n      print(f\"[graph_fwpca_auto_lambda] target_s={target_s:.4f} -> lam={lam:.4f}\")\n\n      B = _one_hot_batches(batches)\n      Zhat = _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=l2)\n      var_total = Zg.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n      var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0, ddof=1), 0.0)\n      R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n      gamma = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2)\n      Zcorr = Zg - (Zhat * gamma)\n\n      Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32),\
    \ batches=batches,\n                                           k_total=k_total, metric=metric,\n                                           delta=delta, k_density=k_density, rng_seed=0)\n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n      adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n      return adata\n```"
