  \ the alpha sweep submission. It’s good to think about heading into the research phase and making sure to incorporate necessary actions seamlessly!**Finalizing submissions and updates**\n\nSince I'm already in the Research Counter, I’ll go ahead and submit two runs with the specified titles. I need to write the pending YAML entries as well. \n\nFor public memory, I have to keep the content minimal. I'll craft the code for both submissions, making sure to change only the alpha_g value while following the correct formatting: each /execute_action on a new line, with the YAML block right after, properly indented. Let's ensure everything is clear and organized!"
