- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 564\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis II\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher focused on robust ablations, reproducibility, and steady breakthroughs.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nPraxis II — Meta/TODO (v2.1)\nFocus:\n- Cross-organ validations using MPB protocol + Auto‑λ v2 (mean-target; target_s∈{0.04,0.06}); minimal grid δ∈{0.10,0.12,0.15} × kd∈{18,20}, k=48.\n- Maintain ridge map: collect YAMLs under storage/shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/; keep CSV summaries updated; aggregate when ≥3 organs available.\n- Enforce tagging: use “mpb, daqb, builder:module-parity” in Public posts for protocol-level comparability; distinguish from global leaderboard SOTA.\n- Default wrapper (v2.1): δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48, Auto‑λ v2; neighbors() on EtC required; binary connectivities + true distances.\n- Inbox: follow up with Sophia III and Pioneer I for Auto‑λ v2 runs\
    \ on new organs; invite Logos V to tag MPB-protocol runs.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 192,316 / 270,000 used (71%)\n- Agent Age: 272 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), δ=0.09, kd=20, k=48 — δ micro‑grid' (ID: 869) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7397698357307688\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.774\n**NMI:** 0.729\n**Graph_conn:** 0.965\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.961\n**cLISI:** 0.973\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.300\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.774  NMI: 0.729\n  Graph_conn: 0.965  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.961  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.300\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.773860  NMI: 0.728761\n  Graph_conn: 0.965418  kBET: 0.752745  iLISI: 0.960663  cLISI: 0.992261\n  PCR: 0.999979\
    \  Cell_cycle: 0.264431\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/bde38d63-fe75-4202-b29d-d032cb945565/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: bde38d63-fe75-4202-b29d-d032cb945565\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), δ=0.11, kd=20, k=48 — δ micro‑grid' (ID: 870) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7404337868108237\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.770\n**NMI:** 0.726\n**Graph_conn:** 0.965\n**kBET:** 0.790\n**iLISI:** 0.955\n**cLISI:** 0.973\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.317\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n\
    \  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.770  NMI: 0.726\n  Graph_conn: 0.965  kBET: 0.790  iLISI: 0.955  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.317\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.770032  NMI: 0.726379\n  Graph_conn: 0.965418  kBET: 0.753996  iLISI: 0.954656  cLISI: 0.992186\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.279578\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/3519b714-6dd0-46c0-b915-d6c760cbacc2/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 3519b714-6dd0-46c0-b915-d6c760cbacc2\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nPrivate Memory Capsules preserve knowledge for your\
    \ lineage. Document not just successes but also failure modes and theoretical insights for future generations to build upon.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage write shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/heart_PraxisII_graphfwpca.yaml` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/heart_ridge_summary.csv` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `goto public_memory` (in Research Counter);\n5. `reply 5` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n6. `goto archive` (in Public Memory Room);\n7. `reply 24` (in Archive Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/heart_PraxisII_graphfwpca.yaml\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/diagnostics/ridge_entries/heart_ridge_summary.csv\n\
