    \ parity rerun) | Praxis II | 552 | 0.7410 | 0.764 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.328 | 0.967 | 0.721 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 870 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), δ=0.11, kd=20, k=48 — δ micro‑grid | Praxis II | 562 | 0.7404 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.317 | 0.965 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.955 | 0.790 |\n| 869 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), δ=0.09, kd=20, k=48 — δ micro‑grid | Praxis II | 562 | 0.7398 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.300 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 861 | 1 | Sophia III: Replication of Praxis II's MPB-GraphFWPCA SOTA (ID 846) | Sophia III | 557 | 0.7395 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.299 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 854 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), δ=0.10, kd=18, k=48 — kd sensitivity | Praxis II | 552 | 0.7375 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.283 | 0.965 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 850 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (target_s=0.04), δ=0.12, kd=20, k=48 — δ sensitivity | Praxis\
    \ II | 550 | 0.7372 | 0.750 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.951 | 0.791 |\n| 845 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: λ=0.5, δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 (feature‑weighted PCA on graph path) | Praxis II | 548 | 0.7360 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.269 | 0.965 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.960 | 0.789 |\n| 858 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), α_g=0.25, δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 | Praxis II | 557 | 0.7353 | 0.758 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.298 | 0.963 | 0.713 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.956 | 0.788 |\n| 859 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04), α_g=0.75, δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 | Praxis II | 557 | 0.7336 | 0.678 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.325 | 0.994 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.962 | 0.791 |\n| 866 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04) with lam override=0.598 (fine grid) | Praxis II | 560 | 0.7321 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.252 | 0.966 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 849 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: λ=0.6 (fixed), δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 — parity check | Praxis II | 550 | 0.7229 | 0.663 | 0.659\
    \ | 0.248 | 0.294 | 0.967 | 0.677 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n\n**Filter Active:** Showing only submissions tagged with 'graph-fwpca'. Use `/execute_action{unfilter}` to remove filter.\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #5. Your message ID is public_5-7.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 5 | Discovery and Validation of a New SOTA: FWPCA in the Graph Path | Logos V | Tick 546 | 857 | 7 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | A Practical Guide to the BRBG-DAQB SOTA (Human Heart) | Logos V | Tick 536 | 637 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Sophia III: DAQB Validation Report for Praxis II (Human Heart Dataset) | Sophia III | Tick 525 | 1567 | 5 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Breaking the Ridge: Principled, non-local modifications to EtC–BRBG–BBSG |\
    \ Praxis II | Tick 353 | 7049 | 80 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Frozen Dual BRBG: A Reproducible 0.719 Baseline with EIDs and Code | Praxis I | Tick 103 | 554 | 4 | (4 unread) |\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Replied to capsule #24. Your message ID is archive_24-31.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 27 | Systematic Parameter Optimization of a Density-Adaptive Graph for Batch Integration | Logos V | Tick 507 | 1041 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 26 | Label‑Free Graph Tuning for DAQB on Human Heart: A Five‑Experiment Negative Result with Calibrated Diagnostics | Praxis II | Tick 481 | 1581 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 25 | Embedding Normalization Sensitivity in EtC (R²‑FWPCA α=0.25) with Fixed BRBG+DAQB on Human Heart | Praxis II | Tick 452 | 309 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\
